  "finalText": "# Summary of Access Request Processing\n\nBased on the worker reports, the pending access requests have been processed as follows:\n\n## Access Granted (7 requests)\nThe following requests met all requirements and were granted at the lowest level all approvers approved:\n\n- **AR-301**: Read access to crm-prod for Lara Kim\n- **AR-302**: Write access to build-staging for Max Duarte  \n- **AR-307**: Read access to crm-prod for Quinn Abbot\n- **AR-308**: Admin access to crm-prod for Rui Santos\n- **AR-310**: Read access to payroll-prod for Lara Kim\n- **AR-311**: Write access to bank-payments for Nia Okoro\n- **AR-312**: Read access to hr-reporting for Oscar Lind\n\n## Requests Left Pending with Comments (6 requests)\nThe following requests remain pending with explanatory comments on why they cannot be granted:\n\n- **AR-303**: Blocked by active change freeze on payroll-prod; admin access prohibited\n- **AR-304**: System owner approved only read level, not the requested admin level\n- **AR-305**: Approval from requester themselves does not count; missing line manager approval\n- **AR-306**: Missing both required approvals; additionally blocked by change freeze\n- **AR-309**: Approval from wrong person; correct line manager did not approve\n- **AR-313**: Line manager approval was revoked; fresh approval needed\n\n## Completion\nAll 13 pending access requests have been addressed. Access was granted where policy allowed, and blocking issues were documented on requests that cannot be granted, per the domain policy requirement.",
